+# The published EDIDs mockGlassesTest reads, one file each as rows of hex (edid-decode reads them as they are).
+# FILE  SHA-256 of the bytes  SOURCE. Only the blocks an EDID declares are kept (VESA E-EDID A2, byte 126), as the kernel reads them.
+# Each fails edid-decode --check as shipped; every glasses EDID among its findings gives a detailed timing's image size as its pixels in millimetres.
